{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["腰帶的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我如此說：「你去買一根麻布帶子束腰，不可放在水中。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我就照着耶和華的話，買了一根帶子束腰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華的話第二次臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「要拿着你所買的腰帶，就是你腰上的帶子，起來往幼發拉底河去，將腰帶藏在那裏的磐石穴中。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我就去，照着耶和華所吩咐我的，將腰帶藏在幼發拉底河邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["過了多日，耶和華對我說：「你起來往幼發拉底河去，將我吩咐你藏在那裏的腰帶取出來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我就往幼發拉底河去，將腰帶從我所藏的地方刨出來，見腰帶已經變壞，毫無用了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「耶和華如此說：我必照樣敗壞猶大的驕傲和耶路撒冷的大驕傲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["這惡民不肯聽我的話，按自己頑梗的心而行，隨從別神，事奉敬拜，他們也必像這腰帶變為無用。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華說：「腰帶怎樣緊貼人腰，照樣，我也使以色列全家和猶大全家緊貼我，好叫他們屬我為子民，使我得名聲，得頌讚，得榮耀；他們卻不肯聽。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["酒罈的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「所以你要對他們說：『耶和華－以色列的上帝如此說：各罈都要盛滿了酒。』他們必對你說：『我們豈不確知各罈都要盛滿了酒呢？』"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你就要對他們說：『耶和華如此說：我必使這地的一切居民，就是坐大衛寶座的君王和祭司，與先知，並耶路撒冷的一切居民，都酩酊大醉。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和華說：「我要使他們彼此相碰，就是父與子彼此相碰；我必不可憐，不顧惜，不憐憫，以致滅絕他們。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米警告狂傲的行為"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"你們當聽，當側耳而聽。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要驕傲，因為耶和華已經說了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華－你們的上帝未使黑暗來到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的腳未在昏暗山上絆跌之先，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當將榮耀歸給他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你們盼望光明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使光明變為死蔭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為幽暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們若不聽這話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必因你們的驕傲在暗地哭泣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我眼必痛哭流淚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的群眾被擄去了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"你要對君王和太后說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當自卑，坐在下邊；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你們的頭巾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你們的華冠，已經脫落了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"南方的城盡都關閉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人開放；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大全被擄掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且擄掠淨盡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你們要舉目觀看從北方來的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先前賜給你的群眾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你佳美的群眾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今在哪裏呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華立你自己所交的朋友為首，轄制你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時你還有甚麼話說呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"痛苦豈不將你抓住像產難的婦人嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若心裏說：這一切事為何臨到我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的衣襟揭起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的腳跟受傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因你的罪孽甚多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實人豈能改變皮膚呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹豈能改變斑點呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若能，你們這習慣行惡的便能行善了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我必用曠野的風吹散他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像吹過的碎稭一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：這是你所當得的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我量給你的分；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你忘記我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倚靠虛假","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要揭起你的衣襟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙在你臉上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"顯出你的醜陋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你那些可憎惡之事－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是在田野的山上行姦淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發嘶聲，做淫亂的事－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都看見了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，你有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不肯潔淨，還要到幾時呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：偶像","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":25}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}